      "text": "This probe covers actionable bot alerts, notification-path failures, and coordinated incident recovery. It combines Google SRE guidance with Freqtrade issue discussions and a first-person bot incident write-up. The claims distinguish sending notifications from receiving commands, notification outages from trading outages, and automatic restart from authorized recovery. Recommendations are identified as design inferences. Historical issue reports remain attributed to their authors; a disputed failure report is preserved with the maintainer\u2019s qualification.",
